1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 5=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,368 --> 00:01:42,950
As long as Young Master is pleased,

7
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:45,959
surely she wouldn't
dare offend First Madam

8
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,079
and Young Master.

9
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,799
I heard

10
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:57,480
Young Madam Liu on Taiping Street

11
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:59,000
had a maid beaten to death.

12
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,040
The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu

13
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:05,040
because the law says

14
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:07,959
masters cannot kill
their servants without due cause.

15
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:11,039
She was sentenced to one year in prison.

16
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,560
What did the maid do wrong?

17
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:22,039
They say Young Master Liu
took a liking to her.

18
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:24,360
Young Madam Liu has quite a temper.

19
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:26,599
In a fit of rage,
she ordered her servants

20
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:29,080
to beat the maid to death.

21
00:02:38,312 --> 00:02:39,960
Do you just hate to see me doing well?

22
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,890
Why else would you say
such things to curse me?

23
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,590
I think you're just jealous
that Young Master rewarded me.

24
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,439
You have to stay alive first

25
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,439
before you
have a chance at a better life.

26
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:06,439
Have you been busy at the barracks?

27
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:09,560
I hardly see you all day.

28
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:12,039
I've been away for many years.

29
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,960
Now that I'm back,

30
00:03:12,970 --> 00:03:15,110
there are inevitably
social obligations to attend to.

31
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,360
Don't drink too much.

32
00:03:16,719 --> 00:03:17,879
Take care of yourself.

33
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,479
All right.

34
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,599
I've obtained something important

35
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,120
and wanted to ask you

36
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,296
what you think I should do.

37
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,800
These complaints

38
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:49,199
were filed
by victims accusing Young Madam

39
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,360
of making usurious loans

40
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:54,000
that drove them to ruin
and tore their families apart.

41
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:56,820
(Defendant: Madam Zhao)

42
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,552
(Defendant: Madam Zhao.
Witness: Chang Asan)

43
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,600
The Zhao family

44
00:04:18,168 --> 00:04:20,890
only rose to prominence after
Old Master Zhao entered officialdom.

45
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:23,160
They believe a woman's
virtue lies in having no talent,

46
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,040
so they refuse
to teach their women to read or write.

47
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:30,560
Zhao Xingtang may be a great beauty,

48
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,879
but she can't read a word.

49
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:35,000
And yet she resorted
to such disgraceful dealings.

50
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:39,920
When your father
insisted on this marriage,

51
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,519
I knew it was unsuitable.

52
00:04:41,528 --> 00:04:42,920
Our families have different values.

53
00:04:42,952 --> 00:04:44,440
How could we ever be a good match?

54
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:47,680
But your father
said the Zhao family's eldest daughter

55
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:50,120
was Old Master Zhao's
favorite granddaughter,

56
00:04:50,264 --> 00:04:52,856
and Old Master Zhao
was a trusted confidant of His Majesty.

57
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,870
For the Zhao family
to agree to this marriage

58
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,680
was a blessing beyond measure for you.

59
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,920
My poor son...

60
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,639
I...

61
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:03,560
I...

62
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,079
Mother.

63
00:05:08,488 --> 00:05:09,870
Father isn't entirely to blame.

64
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,439
Back then, Grandfather

65
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,920
also approved of the marriage.

66
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,720
What do you plan to do about this?

67
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,600
With Judge Zhou's help,

68
00:05:28,072 --> 00:05:30,168
the victims
have all agreed to settle privately.

69
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:32,720
I only brought
these complaints for you to see

70
00:05:32,904 --> 00:05:34,600
so you'd know what has been happening.

71
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,399
And what exactly

72
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,000
do you want me to know?

73
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:55,160
I remember Zhao Xingtang's dowry

74
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:58,040
was only 3,000 taels of silver.

75
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,839
But judging
from the evidence we've found so far,

76
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:04,240
her usurious loans
amounted to far more than that.

77
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:09,000
Do you have proof that Zhao Xingtang

78
00:06:09,496 --> 00:06:11,240
used family funds to make those loans?

79
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,600
Huang Youzhi,
the head shopkeeper of Rongbao Pavilion,

80
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:18,319
and Liu Dacheng,
the head shopkeeper of the rice shop.

81
00:06:18,904 --> 00:06:19,950
There should be others,

82
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:23,959
but I wasn't sure
what you wanted me to do.

83
00:06:24,152 --> 00:06:25,750
I was afraid of alerting Zhao Xingtang,

84
00:06:25,896 --> 00:06:27,510
so I didn't investigate any further.

85
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,560
Those shopkeepers

86
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,879
can be dealt with later.

87
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,720
What matters most right now

88
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,560
is making Zhao Xingtang stop.

89
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,279
If Young Madam
of the Lin family loses face,

90
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,800
then you lose face as well.

91
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,319
If the Lin family loses face,

92
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,000
we can't let this matter get any bigger.

93
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,000
You're right, Mother.

94
00:06:57,112 --> 00:06:58,560
As for matters within the household,

95
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,560
you should stay out of them.

96
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,800
It will keep this
from affecting your marriage.

97
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,480
All right.

98
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,560
Do you know what this is about?

99
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:36,360
Is everyone here?

100
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,399
Yes.

101
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,920
Since everyone is here,

102
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,800
I'll announce some good news.

103
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:51,199
(Wu Suan'er, Madam Qin's housekeeper)

104
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,759
Congratulations, Qingxiang.

105
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,720
Congratulations, Qingxiang.

106
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,656
Yesterday, Second Butler Yang
from the capital

107
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,016
returned to Jinling with a message.

108
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:01,319
First Madam found him capable

109
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,560
and trustworthy.

110
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,399
She thought of Qingxiang,

111
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:07,079
who has served Young Madam faithfully
all these years.

112
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,360
You're already twenty-two

113
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:11,399
and still unmarried.

114
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:14,160
So she agreed
to Second Butler Yang's request

115
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:17,120
and betrothed Qingxiang to him.

116
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:19,560
When Second Butler Yang leaves later,

117
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,839
Qingxiang will board the boat with him.

118
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:25,160
They'll marry as soon
as they reach the capital.

119
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,480
Qingxiang is my maid.

120
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,040
You wretched old woman.

121
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,159
How dare you do something so vile?

122
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,720
Who doesn't know Second Butler Yang

123
00:08:35,752 --> 00:08:37,160
is already well into his forties,

124
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,910
a widower whose wife is dead?

125
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,399
Our Qingxiang

126
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,200
is a fine unmarried young lady.

127
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,840
Why should she marry some old man?

128
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,039
Are you

129
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,240
saying I've lost my judgment?

130
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,279
I wouldn't dare.

131
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,039
Qingxiang has been
by my side since she was little.

132
00:09:02,679 --> 00:09:05,960
I could never bear
to see her marry so far away.

133
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,600
She's not marrying
into some other family.

134
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,712
She'll still be part
of the Lin household.

135
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:13,399
You can see her whenever you wish.

136
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:18,080
Or do you look down on our Lin family?

137
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:19,879
I wouldn't dare.

138
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,000
It's just...

139
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:27,320
Qingxiang's indenture
is still with the Zhao family.

140
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,320
That's a small matter.

141
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:32,000
Send someone to speak with your mother

142
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:33,600
and ask her for the indenture.

143
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:34,320
Yes.

144
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:39,559
No matter how much we say,
it's all pointless

145
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,240
unless

146
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:44,159
we ask Qingxiang whether
she herself is willing to marry.

147
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,759
All right.

148
00:09:47,180 --> 00:09:48,660
No.

149
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,360
I...

150
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,320
Qingxiang.

151
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:56,320
This is the dowry
First Madam prepared for you.

152
00:09:58,399 --> 00:10:00,120
Take a good look.

153
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:01,519
(Defendant: Madam Zhao.
Witness: Chang Asan)

154
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:03,159
Tell your Young Madam

155
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,720
whether you're willing

156
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:07,080
or not.

157
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,000
I... I'm willing.

158
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,559
Qingxiang.

159
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,639
My Lady.

160
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,080
I'm willing.

161
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,720
Qingxiang.

162
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:26,080
I'm willing.

163
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,440
Since Qingxiang has agreed,

164
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:37,600
- Madam.
- then...

165
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,200
Madam.

166
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,399
Madam.

167
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:52,279
Qingxiang has been
with me since she was ten.

168
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,080
All these years,

169
00:10:54,856 --> 00:10:56,872
we may have
been mistress and servant in name,

170
00:10:57,864 --> 00:10:59,750
but in truth,
we've been as close as sisters.

171
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:06,120
Madam, I beg you to show mercy.

172
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,960
Please let Qingxiang stay with me.

173
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,120
I know you can't bear
to part with Qingxiang,

174
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:17,840
but everyone
must marry when the time comes.

175
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,840
Qingxiang herself is willing,

176
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:22,879
so we should grant her wish.

177
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:23,840
No, Madam.

178
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:25,960
She doesn't want this.
Madam, I'm begging you.

179
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,240
She doesn't want this.

180
00:11:27,879 --> 00:11:29,000
- Madam.
- Hurry.

181
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,600
It's getting late.

182
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,279
See Qingxiang out.

183
00:11:32,328 --> 00:11:33,510
Don't let her miss the boat.

184
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,200
Qingxiang,

185
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,159
this way, please.

186
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,120
Qingxiang.

187
00:11:39,399 --> 00:11:40,120
Qingxiang.

188
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,799
Qingxiang.

189
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,480
Qingxiang.

190
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:58,460
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

191
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:19,799
Why is everyone so quiet?

192
00:13:22,919 --> 00:13:24,799
Qingxiang left so suddenly.

193
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,799
Aren't you sad?

194
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:30,320
She's not my real sister.

195
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,840
Why would I be sad?

196
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:33,600
Besides,

197
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,080
now that she's gone,

198
00:13:37,559 --> 00:13:39,399
we should all be happy.

199
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,840
A first-class maid's position is vacant.

200
00:13:42,850 --> 00:13:45,190
They'll promote someone
from the second-class maids, right?

201
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:47,460
Then a second-class
position will be vacant,

202
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,990
so someone from
the third-class maids will be promoted.

203
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,320
We're not Young Madam's people.

204
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,000
There's no chance we'll be promoted.

205
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,056
We'll be lucky
if nothing bad happens to us.

206
00:13:58,559 --> 00:13:59,360
Bad luck?

207
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,919
How so?

208
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,440
Didn't you see Young Madam today?

209
00:14:06,504 --> 00:14:08,648
First Madam usually
leaves the household affairs alone

210
00:14:08,696 --> 00:14:09,592
and rarely says much.

211
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,639
But once she speaks,

212
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:15,120
Young Madam
has no choice but to obey.

213
00:14:15,759 --> 00:14:17,240
And we're First Madam's people.

214
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,399
My mother always says,

215
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:22,159
when the powerful clash,

216
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,759
ordinary people suffer.

217
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,960
Ji'er, Yingge, Xiaolian, and Lanxiang.

218
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,279
Young Madam wants to see you.

219
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,679
Coming.

220
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,039
Go on.

221
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:47,960
Eat it in secret.

222
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,360
Don't let those two see.

223
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,360
Young Madam is waiting.

224
00:14:52,399 --> 00:14:53,120
Hurry.

225
00:14:59,159 --> 00:15:00,639
Hurry, Lanxiang.

226
00:15:05,759 --> 00:15:06,879
You four

227
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:10,600
were all carefully chosen
and sent here by First Madam.

228
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:13,039
Even if you are First Madam's people,

229
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:15,120
you must still follow
the rules of this household.

230
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,919
The first rule

231
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,919
is that you must not steal.

232
00:15:24,056 --> 00:15:25,630
Whichever one of you stole something,

233
00:15:26,399 --> 00:15:27,480
confess now,

234
00:15:29,159 --> 00:15:30,639
and I may show you some leniency.

235
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:33,240
But if I catch you
with the stolen goods,

236
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:35,879
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

237
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:41,360
I didn't steal anything.

238
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,399
I have no idea

239
00:15:44,312 --> 00:15:45,704
what the others may have done.

240
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:49,919
Young Madam,

241
00:15:49,928 --> 00:15:51,200
I swear I didn't steal anything.

242
00:15:53,759 --> 00:15:54,559
Young Madam,

243
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,320
I didn't steal anything either.

244
00:15:56,639 --> 00:15:58,919
And I never saw any of the other girls

245
00:15:58,919 --> 00:16:00,480
take anything they shouldn't have.

246
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,080
I didn't steal anything either.

247
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:04,919
If you don't believe me,

248
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,480
you can search me right now.

249
00:16:42,159 --> 00:16:43,159
That's not mine.

250
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:45,159
I've never seen that gold ring before.

251
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,639
Young Madam!

252
00:16:47,679 --> 00:16:48,720
That's not mine.

253
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:49,799
Young Madam!

254
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,120
That's not mine!

255
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,159
Young Madam.

256
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,120
Young Madam.

257
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:56,240
I gave that ring to Zijin.

258
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:58,720
I never thought you'd steal it from her.

259
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,240
You've been caught
with the stolen goods.

260
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,279
No!

261
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,119
Even First Madam

262
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:05,319
would never tolerate

263
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:07,319
a thieving servant like you.

264
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:10,880
Tie her up.

265
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:11,759
Young Madam!

266
00:17:12,039 --> 00:17:12,680
It's not mine.

267
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:13,680
It really isn't mine!

268
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,279
Stolen goods

269
00:17:14,279 --> 00:17:15,450
wouldn't be yours, of course.

270
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,640
Get up there.

271
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:26,039
Young Master sent someone
to the tearoom for tea,

272
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,519
but you, a third-class maid,

273
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:31,960
went to Sanjue Hall
to deliver it without permission.

274
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:34,640
Clearly, you've never
had any regard for the rules.

275
00:17:36,519 --> 00:17:37,359
These past two days,

276
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,759
you asked
the servant guarding the side gate

277
00:17:39,839 --> 00:17:42,559
to buy you pine nut candy
and fashionable silk flowers.

278
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,480
You even sent one tael of silver home.

279
00:17:46,759 --> 00:17:47,599
Clearly,

280
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:49,759
you're not the only thief.

281
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:53,079
Your whole family is a pack of thieves.

282
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,839
Young Master gave me that silver.

283
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,319
Who would believe
you got two taels of silver

284
00:17:58,319 --> 00:17:59,960
just for delivering two jars of tea?

285
00:18:00,799 --> 00:18:02,440
Zijin has delivered tea
plenty of times,

286
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:04,799
and she's never come back
with so much as half a tael.

287
00:18:05,079 --> 00:18:07,440
Are you saying
you're more capable than Zijin?

288
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,359
Young Master really gave it to me.

289
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,359
He can vouch for me.

290
00:18:14,616 --> 00:18:16,240
Young Master has gone
to the Garrison.

291
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,119
Do you really think

292
00:18:18,559 --> 00:18:20,480
he'd abandon
his official duties and rush back

293
00:18:20,519 --> 00:18:22,319
for a worthless servant like you?

294
00:18:23,079 --> 00:18:26,160
Even if Young Master
did give you that silver,

295
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,319
what about this ring?

296
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:29,359
Did Young Master give you that, too?

297
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,880
That ring isn't mine.

298
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,904
That ring isn't mine.

299
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,740
Young Madam,
don't waste your breath on her.

300
00:18:36,759 --> 00:18:38,079
A greedy,

301
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,720
dishonest servant like her

302
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,079
should be beaten to death.

303
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:44,279
Beat her!

304
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,319
Young Madam!

305
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:50,319
Young Madam!

306
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:54,839
Young Madam!

307
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,279
I've never seen that ring before.

308
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:01,440
I've truly never seen
that gold ring before!

309
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,960
I didn't steal it!

310
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:05,319
I didn't steal it!

311
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,480
I didn't steal it.

312
00:19:18,279 --> 00:19:20,240
I didn't steal it...

313
00:19:24,319 --> 00:19:26,920
I didn't steal it...

314
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:31,480
I didn't steal it...

315
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:56,319
Young Madam!

316
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,279
It was my fault.

317
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:58,839
I didn't mean to do it.

318
00:19:59,016 --> 00:20:00,952
Young Madam,
please don't beat me to death.

319
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:02,952
Young Madam,
please don't beat me to death.

320
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,119
I didn't mean to do it.

321
00:20:07,224 --> 00:20:09,110
Please, Young Madam,
don't beat me to death.

322
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:09,839
Please don't!

323
00:20:09,839 --> 00:20:11,680
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

324
00:20:11,759 --> 00:20:13,000
(had a maid beaten to death.)

325
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,079
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

326
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,519
(had a maid beaten to death.)

327
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,799
(The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu.)

328
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,920
(They said that under the law.)

329
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,240
(I heard)

330
00:20:30,079 --> 00:20:31,839
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

331
00:20:32,079 --> 00:20:33,319
(had a maid beaten to death.)

332
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:35,640
(The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu.)

333
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:40,000
- They said that under the law,
- (They said that under the law...)

334
00:20:40,152 --> 00:20:45,750
masters cannot kill
their servants without due cause...

335
00:20:47,119 --> 00:20:51,680
Young Madam Liu
was sentenced to one year in prison.

336
00:20:53,839 --> 00:20:55,960
One year in prison...

337
00:21:03,359 --> 00:21:04,480
Did that really happen?

338
00:21:06,359 --> 00:21:07,920
I believe it did.

339
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:24,359
You may escape death,

340
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,359
but you won't escape punishment.

341
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,680
Lv Ji'er conspired with her family

342
00:21:51,799 --> 00:21:53,720
to steal Young Madam's belongings.

343
00:21:54,240 --> 00:21:55,519
Young Madam has ordered

344
00:21:56,119 --> 00:21:59,240
the entire family
to be taken away and sold.

345
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,720
No!

346
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:03,839
No!

347
00:22:06,519 --> 00:22:07,440
Young Madam, have mercy!

348
00:22:07,450 --> 00:22:08,430
Young Madam, have mercy!

349
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,112
Please, no!

350
00:22:09,144 --> 00:22:09,830
Please spare us!

351
00:22:09,839 --> 00:22:12,000
Don't sell the whole family
to the same household.

352
00:22:12,359 --> 00:22:13,400
Otherwise,

353
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:16,160
they may join forces
and cause trouble for another family.

354
00:22:17,359 --> 00:22:18,240
We were wrong!

355
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,559
We truly were!

356
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,880
- Have mercy!
- Move!

357
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:22,279
Move!

358
00:22:25,599 --> 00:22:26,200
Move!

359
00:22:29,900 --> 00:22:32,140
Father!

360
00:22:32,780 --> 00:22:35,020
- Move!
- Father!

361
00:22:36,420 --> 00:22:37,860
Move!

362
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:39,740
- Move!
- Move!

363
00:23:14,799 --> 00:23:16,599
This is what happens

364
00:23:16,632 --> 00:23:19,144
to those with wicked intentions
who betray their masters.

365
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:21,079
Young Madam ordered

366
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,480
you should all take a good look

367
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:25,200
and remember this well.

368
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,000
Have you seen clearly?

369
00:23:29,799 --> 00:23:30,839
Yes.

370
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,839
- Yes.
- Yes.

371
00:23:47,119 --> 00:23:48,440
You are

372
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,839
Lanxiang's parents?

373
00:23:57,599 --> 00:23:58,799
My father is Xu Wanquan.

374
00:23:59,119 --> 00:24:00,279
My mother is Xue Guihua.

375
00:24:00,519 --> 00:24:01,640
My name is Xu Lanxiang.

376
00:24:04,559 --> 00:24:06,799
Now that you're serving
in Young Madam's courtyard,

377
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:09,240
you must follow her rules.

378
00:24:09,559 --> 00:24:10,359
Otherwise,

379
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:13,079
you won't be the only one to suffer.

380
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:14,880
Your parents will suffer as well.

381
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,440
Do you understand?

382
00:24:20,359 --> 00:24:21,039
Yes.

383
00:24:23,799 --> 00:24:24,440
Go back.

384
00:24:35,119 --> 00:24:36,799
You in the back, keep up.

385
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:48,720
Let's go. Come on, let's go.

386
00:25:52,519 --> 00:25:53,960
I was so absentminded.

387
00:25:54,799 --> 00:25:57,440
I'd been meaning to give her
the sachet I just embroidered.

388
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,839
But when I saw her today,

389
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,960
it completely slipped my mind.

390
00:26:01,592 --> 00:26:02,504
All right, enough.

391
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:07,720
Young Madam was clearly
making an example of them.

392
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:10,000
You can't go
and cause more trouble for Lanxiang.

393
00:26:12,008 --> 00:26:14,350
If I'd known life in the residence
would be this difficult,

394
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,799
we might as well
have married her off early.

395
00:26:19,279 --> 00:26:21,759
You may be willing
to marry Lanxiang off to just anyone,

396
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,440
but I'm not.

397
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:29,160
Then what do we do now?

398
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,599
Just sit around and wait?

399
00:26:32,599 --> 00:26:33,839
I've been thinking.

400
00:26:35,599 --> 00:26:36,880
We should put up some money

401
00:26:37,030 --> 00:26:38,888
and ask someone
to help make arrangements,

402
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:41,839
so we can at least
exchange messages with her.

403
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,720
Then hurry and do it.

404
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,880
We can earn the money back slowly.

405
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,799
As long as our child has a good life,

406
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:50,279
I don't mind how hard I have to work.

407
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,920
Then it's settled.

408
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:05,599
Lv Ji'er and her family
have all been sent away.

409
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:08,759
But they're servants of the Lin family.

410
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,279
Their indentures...

411
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:13,160
Indentures?

412
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:16,559
Didn't First Madam say

413
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,359
that for such a small matter,

414
00:27:19,759 --> 00:27:22,279
we only need
to send someone to inform her?

415
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:24,039
But...

416
00:27:29,279 --> 00:27:30,160
What are you afraid of?

417
00:27:31,079 --> 00:27:33,440
If she can dispose
of a maid from my Zhao family,

418
00:27:34,039 --> 00:27:35,160
why can't I dispose of a few

419
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:36,880
servants from the Lin family?

420
00:27:40,279 --> 00:27:41,079
My Lady.

421
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,720
First Madam is here.

422
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:46,160
It's First Madam of the Zhao family.

423
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,240
Mother?

424
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:51,640
First Madam.

425
00:28:00,119 --> 00:28:00,920
Mother.

426
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:05,359
Mother.

427
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:06,680
What brings you here?

428
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:08,039
Is something the matter?

429
00:28:10,408 --> 00:28:12,230
(An Moli, Zhao Xingtang's Mother)
Listen to you.

430
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:14,400
(First Madam of the Zhao Family)
Can't I visit you without a reason?

431
00:28:15,599 --> 00:28:17,200
I'm simply a mother

432
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,240
who misses her daughter.

433
00:28:29,279 --> 00:28:31,519
Your hands are still cold.

434
00:28:31,839 --> 00:28:34,480
Why hasn't your uterine chill improved?

435
00:28:42,160 --> 00:28:43,839
Drinking tea alone won't help.

436
00:28:44,232 --> 00:28:45,960
You need to take your medicine properly.

437
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:48,039
You're already twenty-three.

438
00:28:48,599 --> 00:28:51,240
You can't keep acting
willfully like a child.

439
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,319
You know very well

440
00:28:54,319 --> 00:28:56,559
why I developed this uterine chill.

441
00:28:58,039 --> 00:29:00,519
You married me into the Lin family

442
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:02,152
without caring whether I lived or died.

443
00:29:02,559 --> 00:29:04,359
Why say all this now?

444
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,000
Go on.

445
00:29:16,839 --> 00:29:17,880
What did you come here for?

446
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,279
Your father said

447
00:29:24,519 --> 00:29:28,359
your husband hasn't visited us
once since he returned.

448
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:30,960
He's worried
the two of you are at odds again,

449
00:29:32,200 --> 00:29:33,759
so he asked me to come and see you.

450
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,400
He told me to remind you

451
00:29:38,079 --> 00:29:39,480
to rein in your temper

452
00:29:40,079 --> 00:29:42,640
and not damage
your relationship with your husband.

453
00:29:44,039 --> 00:29:45,160
Your father also said

454
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:48,000
Old Master
favors our branch of the family

455
00:29:48,712 --> 00:29:50,960
not because of that
good-for-nothing brother of yours,

456
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,319
but because of your husband.

457
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,480
You may not have had an education,

458
00:29:55,864 --> 00:29:57,480
but you certainly know
what the books say

459
00:29:57,592 --> 00:29:59,270
about a husband
being a wife's whole world

460
00:29:59,359 --> 00:30:00,720
better than anyone.

461
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:03,279
You follow it far better

462
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:05,079
than my well-read mother-in-law.

463
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,519
Isn't that simply

464
00:30:13,319 --> 00:30:15,559
the fate of women like us?

465
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,200
What if I refuse to accept that fate?

466
00:30:23,359 --> 00:30:24,440
Your father said so,

467
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,559
and I feel the same way.

468
00:30:27,279 --> 00:30:29,359
You should
have a child as soon as possible.

469
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:31,559
Only then can you
keep your husband's heart.

470
00:30:32,039 --> 00:30:33,119
I can't have children.

471
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:36,039
Then choose a pretty maid.

472
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:38,599
Once she gives birth,
send her far away.

473
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,119
Raise the child by your side,

474
00:30:40,359 --> 00:30:41,440
and the child will be yours.

475
00:30:41,440 --> 00:30:43,288
- It's getting late!
- Just like your own.

476
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,519
If there's nothing else,

477
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,359
you should hurry home.

478
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,000
Everything your parents do

479
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:10,079
is for your own good.

480
00:31:11,119 --> 00:31:12,599
You need to listen to us

481
00:31:13,599 --> 00:31:14,480
and do as we say.

482
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,440
My Lady.

483
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,079
Make preparations.

484
00:31:46,216 --> 00:31:47,830
We're going to Jinxiu House tomorrow.

485
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:50,160
My Lady.

486
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:51,680
In this world,

487
00:31:54,759 --> 00:31:56,240
not all parents

488
00:31:56,792 --> 00:31:58,550
consider what's best
for their daughters.

489
00:32:03,279 --> 00:32:04,759
I can only rely on myself.

490
00:32:15,700 --> 00:32:18,260
(Jinxiu House)

491
00:32:41,220 --> 00:32:45,460
(Qian Shaoze, Zhao Xingtang's Cousin)

492
00:32:45,759 --> 00:32:47,079
Why are 600 taels missing?

493
00:32:48,536 --> 00:32:49,680
The accounts are correct.

494
00:32:50,799 --> 00:32:53,079
I had 600 taels sent to Qingxiang.

495
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:55,208
It's her first time in the capital.

496
00:32:55,590 --> 00:32:56,856
She doesn't know anyone there.

497
00:32:57,799 --> 00:32:59,200
Having some money on hand

498
00:32:59,759 --> 00:33:01,079
will make things easier for her.

499
00:33:03,119 --> 00:33:04,279
With 600 taels,

500
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:07,030
you could buy
plenty of maids like Qingxiang.

501
00:33:09,359 --> 00:33:12,839
Do you think a maid
who can read and keep accounts

502
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,960
is so easy to find?

503
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:19,000
But didn't you

504
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,759
buy Qingxiang for ten taels back then?

505
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:25,720
Even if I were lucky enough

506
00:33:25,768 --> 00:33:27,830
to find another maid
who can read and keep accounts,

507
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,640
could she be like Qingxiang,

508
00:33:30,079 --> 00:33:31,680
who grew up with me

509
00:33:31,752 --> 00:33:33,672
and has always been utterly loyal to me?

510
00:33:34,519 --> 00:33:36,240
There can never be another Qingxiang.

511
00:33:41,319 --> 00:33:42,440
I was wrong.

512
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:44,160
Six hundred taels it is.

513
00:33:45,119 --> 00:33:47,119
We'll just earn it back later.

514
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:57,000
Zijin is no help at all.

515
00:33:59,359 --> 00:34:02,200
What am I going to do
about the accounts from now on?

516
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:07,416
Let me show you something.

517
00:34:20,079 --> 00:34:21,159
Six years ago,

518
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:24,079
I had this pair
of mandarin duck seals carved

519
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:25,576
from the tianhuang stone in my dowry.

520
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:28,599
I gave you the raised-carving duck seal,

521
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:31,719
and kept
the recessed-carving mate for myself.

522
00:34:42,159 --> 00:34:45,119
From now on,
I'll calculate the accounts and money

523
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,440
that Zijin brings back for you.

524
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:49,679
(Gold)
You only need to look for this seal.

525
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:54,880
Whenever I receive them,

526
00:34:55,519 --> 00:34:56,920
I'll stamp them with my own seal.

527
00:34:57,672 --> 00:34:59,672
Then you'll know
I've received the money?

528
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:04,679
You're the clever one.

529
00:35:07,016 --> 00:35:08,824
I thought it would be a few more years

530
00:35:08,888 --> 00:35:10,590
before we'd have
any use for these seals.

531
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:13,400
I didn't expect
they'd come in handy so soon.

532
00:35:19,576 --> 00:35:20,952
Just hold on a little longer.

533
00:35:21,224 --> 00:35:22,712
Once we've saved enough money,

534
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:24,840
we can leave the Lin family.

535
00:35:48,780 --> 00:35:53,960
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

536
00:35:54,056 --> 00:35:55,480
How long has First Madam been here?

537
00:35:55,519 --> 00:35:56,679
About 15 minutes.

538
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,079
I said I'd send you to her

539
00:35:58,079 --> 00:35:59,239
as soon as you returned,

540
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:01,519
but First Madam
said there was no hurry.

541
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:03,944
She had nothing else to do,
so she'd have some tea and wait.

542
00:36:04,199 --> 00:36:04,920
Nanny, do you know

543
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,239
why First Madam is here?

544
00:36:06,239 --> 00:36:07,639
Stop looking so miserable.

545
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,119
If it's not because I went out,

546
00:36:09,239 --> 00:36:10,960
it must be because I took it upon myself

547
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:12,376
to dispose of Ji'er and her family.

548
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:13,559
That's exactly why.

549
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:20,679
Go fetch Xiaolian and Lanxiang.

550
00:36:20,728 --> 00:36:22,472
Have them
wait outside the hall for orders.

551
00:36:23,960 --> 00:36:24,679
Hurry up.

552
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:25,280
Yes.

553
00:36:43,559 --> 00:36:44,239
Madam.

554
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:48,920
The silk shop received a new shipment,

555
00:36:49,239 --> 00:36:50,480
so I went to have a look.

556
00:36:50,679 --> 00:36:52,079
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

557
00:36:52,199 --> 00:36:53,599
It was my fault.

558
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:59,880
Our Lin family has never forbidden
our daughters-in-law from going out.

559
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:03,360
But from now on,
take a few more maids with you.

560
00:37:04,039 --> 00:37:05,280
With only Zijin by your side,

561
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:06,888
those who don't know better

562
00:37:06,890 --> 00:37:08,920
might think
the Lin family mistreats you.

563
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:11,960
You're right, Madam.

564
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:13,480
I'll remember that.

565
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:21,960
Lv Er and his family
were caught stealing.

566
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:25,599
Since you've already
sent them away, so be it.

567
00:37:26,679 --> 00:37:28,400
I really had no other choice.

568
00:37:29,119 --> 00:37:31,440
People like that can't be kept on.

569
00:37:33,256 --> 00:37:35,030
I've managed
this household for many years.

570
00:37:36,079 --> 00:37:37,760
Lv Er and his family
always did their duty

571
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:39,079
and never caused any trouble.

572
00:37:40,136 --> 00:37:41,944
Yet that changed under your management.

573
00:37:46,519 --> 00:37:48,400
Servants are like mules and horses.

574
00:37:48,792 --> 00:37:50,920
Manage them well,
and they'll be docile and obedient.

575
00:37:50,968 --> 00:37:53,512
Manage them poorly, and they'll
become unruly and hard to handle.

576
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,239
You

577
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:56,800
are still too young.

578
00:37:58,680 --> 00:37:59,800
I'm partly to blame as well.

579
00:38:00,424 --> 00:38:02,376
I've taken things easy
these past few years

580
00:38:02,599 --> 00:38:04,039
and left this entire household

581
00:38:04,039 --> 00:38:05,880
for you to manage on your own.

582
00:38:06,199 --> 00:38:07,280
I think

583
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:10,119
I'll take back
the household authority tokens for now

584
00:38:10,472 --> 00:38:12,584
and shoulder
the burden for a few more years.

585
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:28,320
Madam Feng, please bring me the tokens.

586
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:36,719
Madam.

587
00:38:37,159 --> 00:38:38,599
I'm young and inexperienced.

588
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:39,920
If I've done anything poorly,

589
00:38:40,119 --> 00:38:41,119
please teach me,

590
00:38:41,150 --> 00:38:42,376
and I promise I'll correct it.

591
00:38:43,016 --> 00:38:45,160
If you take back
the household authority tokens,

592
00:38:45,559 --> 00:38:46,519
how can I

593
00:38:47,719 --> 00:38:48,840
face anyone after this?

594
00:38:50,559 --> 00:38:51,599
Look at you.

595
00:38:52,199 --> 00:38:54,159
I'm doing this for your own good.

596
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:56,719
This will give you time to rest

597
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:58,480
and restore your health.

598
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,760
Jinqi is the eldest grandson.

599
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,679
Old Master and Old Madam

600
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:05,480
are both eagerly
awaiting a great-grandson.

601
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:12,480
Madam.

602
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:15,159
Yesterday, my mother

603
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:17,599
also spoke to me about having a child.

604
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:20,320
She said Grandfather had written

605
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:22,200
and mentioned
the matter of an heir as well.

606
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,760
I thought about it all night.

607
00:39:24,239 --> 00:39:25,239
Early this morning,

608
00:39:25,559 --> 00:39:27,480
I went to the shop
and bought some new silk

609
00:39:28,239 --> 00:39:30,199
to give to Xiaolian and Lanxiang.

610
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:38,480
Xiaolian, Lanxiang.

611
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:39,960
Come in.

612
00:39:51,064 --> 00:39:52,328
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

613
00:39:57,000 --> 00:39:58,239
From today onward,

614
00:39:59,039 --> 00:40:00,119
the two of them

615
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:02,400
will be second-class maids

616
00:40:03,599 --> 00:40:05,159
and serve by my side.

617
00:40:09,679 --> 00:40:10,880
These two pieces of silk...

618
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,840
One is for Xiaolian,

619
00:40:13,679 --> 00:40:15,599
and the other is for Lanxiang.

620
00:40:16,079 --> 00:40:17,480
Take their measurements

621
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:19,119
and make each of them an outfit.

622
00:40:19,599 --> 00:40:21,280
Dress them nicely.

623
00:40:21,599 --> 00:40:23,199
If Young Master is pleased,

624
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,679
I'll be pleased, too.

625
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:35,079
Madam.

626
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:39,000
Are you pleased with the fabric I chose?

627
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,639
I've always trusted

628
00:40:42,199 --> 00:40:43,599
your taste.

629
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:49,039
I'm glad you're pleased, Madam.

630
00:40:50,599 --> 00:40:54,199
Thank you, First Madam
and Young Madam.

631
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:56,320
You just got back.

632
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:57,840
You must be tired.

633
00:40:57,880 --> 00:40:59,039
Get some rest.

634
00:40:59,119 --> 00:41:00,400
I won't stay any longer.

635
00:41:01,679 --> 00:41:02,280
Yes.

636
00:41:17,840 --> 00:41:18,960
Take care, Madam.

637
00:41:36,472 --> 00:41:39,112
Make the arrangements
for these two as I just instructed.

638
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:40,559
Yes.

639
00:41:44,792 --> 00:41:46,480
Now that you're
second-class maids, you'll

640
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,216
share a room
with just one other person.

641
00:41:48,248 --> 00:41:50,030
But Young Madam
hasn't promoted anyone

642
00:41:50,239 --> 00:41:51,880
to fill Qingxiang's position yet,

643
00:41:51,960 --> 00:41:53,630
so there aren't
any vacant rooms for now.

644
00:41:54,230 --> 00:41:56,056
This room happens
to be one person short,

645
00:41:56,199 --> 00:41:57,920
and Yingge is quiet,

646
00:41:58,119 --> 00:42:00,920
so I'm afraid
you'll have to make do here for now.

647
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:03,440
I'm used to living here.

648
00:42:03,559 --> 00:42:04,599
I'd rather not move.

649
00:42:05,440 --> 00:42:06,320
Me too.

650
00:42:11,119 --> 00:42:13,840
If either of you
catches Young Master's eye,

651
00:42:14,239 --> 00:42:16,840
you may soon have a room of your own.

652
00:42:17,679 --> 00:42:21,400
Then you'll have whatever you want.

653
00:42:26,239 --> 00:42:28,559
You have half the day off today.

654
00:42:29,039 --> 00:42:30,199
The tailor will come by later

655
00:42:30,199 --> 00:42:31,400
to take your measurements.

656
00:42:31,800 --> 00:42:32,760
Tomorrow morning,

657
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:34,800
report to Young Madam
for instructions.

658
00:43:04,980 --> 00:43:07,420
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

659
00:43:08,719 --> 00:43:11,119
Do you want to know
what happened afterward?

660
00:43:14,079 --> 00:43:15,039
What happened?

661
00:43:16,079 --> 00:43:17,639
When I saw the storyteller out,

662
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:19,320
she told me everything.

663
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:21,496
Later, Second Master Yang killed
the adulterous pair

664
00:43:21,500 --> 00:43:22,550
with a single stroke.

665
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:24,440
Then, fearing the scandal would spread

666
00:43:24,559 --> 00:43:25,519
and disgrace his family,

667
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:29,679
he killed several of the older maids
and young maids in the household, too.

668
00:43:33,039 --> 00:43:33,519
Yang...

669
00:43:54,140 --> 00:43:58,260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

670
00:44:01,100 --> 00:44:05,620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

671
00:44:06,900 --> 00:44:10,820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

672
00:44:11,500 --> 00:44:14,260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

673
00:44:14,980 --> 00:44:17,300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

674
00:44:17,300 --> 00:44:20,380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

675
00:44:21,900 --> 00:44:26,140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

676
00:44:29,060 --> 00:44:33,220
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

677
00:44:35,020 --> 00:44:38,580
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

678
00:44:38,580 --> 00:44:42,140
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

679
00:44:42,940 --> 00:44:48,620
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

680
00:44:48,980 --> 00:44:53,300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

681
00:44:53,660 --> 00:44:56,620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

682
00:44:56,620 --> 00:45:00,380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

683
00:45:00,380 --> 00:45:03,260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

684
00:45:03,260 --> 00:45:07,340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

685
00:45:07,340 --> 00:45:10,700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

686
00:45:10,700 --> 00:45:14,460
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

687
00:45:14,460 --> 00:45:18,460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

688
00:45:19,220 --> 00:45:23,380
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

689
00:45:23,380 --> 00:45:26,820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

690
